# PDA mode (launcher report 044): the Search field's writing band at 480x800 and 480x640 (D-41): the band shows where the
# keyboard would, the results above it, written letters reach the field
title Vinyl P2b: Search with the PDA writing band (480x800, 480x640)
band
sizes 480x800 480x640
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library

keyboards 0
wait 1200
expect band hidden
tap "Search"
wait 800
expect band shown
expect osk off
shot 01-search-band
write letters f e n
wait 900
shot 02-search-written
expect text "SONGS"
zonekey Keyb
wait 500
expect osk on
expect band hidden
shot 03-search-keyb
tapkey CLOSE
wait 500
expect band shown
keyboards 1
wait 1300
expect osk off
expect band hidden
shot 04-search-keyboard
keyboards 0
wait 1300
key esc
wait 600
expect text "Folders"
